{"id":"31710fa05b4ffe92","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-ode.md","title":"Ordinary Differential Equation","display":"df-ode — Ordinary Differential Equation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ode","aliases":["58-df-ode","Ordinary Differential Equation"],"display":"df-ode — Ordinary Differential Equation","depends_on":["[[58-df-initial-condition]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ode"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ode</span><span>Ordinary Differential Equation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ode — Ordinary Differential Equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6641b33d894aa637\" href=\"?note=6641b33d894aa637\" title=\"58-df-initial-condition\">58-df-initial-condition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span> (interval)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m\\)</span> (state domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:I\\times U\\to\\mathbb R^m\">\\(f:I\\times U\\to\\mathbb R^m\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y:I\\to U\">\\(y:I\\to U\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_0\\in I\">\\(t_0\\in I\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_0\\in U\">\\(y_0\\in U\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S\\)</span> (initial-value predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6641b33d894aa637\" href=\"?note=6641b33d894aa637\" title=\"58-df-initial-condition\">58-df-initial-condition</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(y,v,I,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(y,v,I,m)\\)</span> (vector-valued derivative-map predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ODESolution}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ODESolution}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NthOrderODESolution}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{NthOrderODESolution}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ode\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(y,v,I,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(y,I,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,I,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land t+h\\in I\\to\\left\\lVert\\frac{y(t+h)-y(t)}{h}-v(t)\\right\\rVert&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ode\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(y,v,I,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(y,I,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,I,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land t+h\\in I\\to\\left\\lVert\\frac{y(t+h)-y(t)}{h}-v(t)\\right\\rVert&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ode\\text{-}first\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\operatorname{ODESolution}_S(y,f,I,U,t_0,y_0,m)\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,I\\times U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S(y,I,U,t_0,y_0)\\land\\exists v\\;\\left(\\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(y,v,I,m)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;(v(t)=f(\\langle t,y(t)\\rangle))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ode\\text{-}first\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\operatorname{ODESolution}_S(y,f,I,U,t_0,y_0,m)\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,I\\times U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S(y,I,U,t_0,y_0)\\land\\exists v\\;\\left(\\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(y,v,I,m)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;(v(t)=f(\\langle t,y(t)\\rangle))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ode\\text{-}nth\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\operatorname{NthOrderODESolution}_S(y,f,d,n,I,m)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land d\\in V^{n+1}\\land d(0)=y\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;\\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(d(j),d(j+1),I,m)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,I\\times(\\mathbb R^m)^n,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\left(d(n)(t)=f(\\langle t,\\{\\langle j,d(j)(t)\\rangle:j\\in n\\}\\rangle)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ode\\text{-}nth\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\operatorname{NthOrderODESolution}_S(y,f,d,n,I,m)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land d\\in V^{n+1}\\land d(0)=y\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;\\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(d(j),d(j+1),I,m)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,I\\times(\\mathbb R^m)^n,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\left(d(n)(t)=f(\\langle t,\\{\\langle j,d(j)(t)\\rangle:j\\in n\\}\\rangle)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>These predicates define first-order initial-value solutions and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>th-order solutions.</li>\n<li>Peano existence and Picard-Lindelof existence-and-uniqueness require local domain and regularity hypotheses and therefore belong in theorem atoms.</li>\n<li>An <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>th-order equation can be converted to a first-order system on a product state space.</li>\n<li>The state passed to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> is the explicit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-tuple function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\mapsto d(j)(t)\">\\(j\\mapsto d(j)(t)\\)</span>; no variable-length tuple ellipsis remains in the assertion.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Coddington and Levinson, Theory of Ordinary Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Hartman, Ordinary Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-initial-condition","status":"resolved","id":"6641b33d894aa637","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-initial-condition]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-initial-condition","status":"resolved","id":"6641b33d894aa637","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S$ (initial-value predicate, see [[58-df-initial-condition]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m","display":false},{"tex":"f:I\\times U\\to\\mathbb R^m","display":false},{"tex":"y:I\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"t_0\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"y_0\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(y,v,I,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ODESolution}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NthOrderODESolution}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ode\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(y,v,I,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(y,I,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,I,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0<|h|<\\delta\\land t+h\\in I\\to\\left\\lVert\\frac{y(t+h)-y(t)}{h}-v(t)\\right\\rVert<\\varepsilon\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ode\\text{-}first\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\operatorname{ODESolution}_S(y,f,I,U,t_0,y_0,m)\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,I\\times U,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\mathrm{InitialCondition}_S(y,I,U,t_0,y_0)\\land\\exists v\\;\\left(\\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(y,v,I,m)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;(v(t)=f(\\langle t,y(t)\\rangle))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ode\\text{-}nth\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\operatorname{NthOrderODESolution}_S(y,f,d,n,I,m)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land d\\in V^{n+1}\\land d(0)=y\\land\\forall j<n\\;\\mathrm{DerivativeMap}_S(d(j),d(j+1),I,m)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,I\\times(\\mathbb R^m)^n,\\mathbb R^m)\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\left(d(n)(t)=f(\\langle t,\\{\\langle j,d(j)(t)\\rangle:j\\in n\\}\\rangle)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"j\\mapsto d(j)(t)","display":false}],"bytes":2572,"backlinks":[{"id":"cfa80659b9d38f63","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ODESolution}_S$ (typed first-order ODE-solution predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-ode.md]])"},{"id":"ec822da63d54930d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-898","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-ode.md|58-df-ode]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["6641b33d894aa637","36d7463d215be751"]}